    "current_structure_assessment": "The current use of 'area' as a high-level category and 'nature' as a subtype is a reasonable start but limited in scalability and expressiveness. 'Area' values like 'Phishing Attack' are somewhat redundant with 'nature' subtypes that are also attack types. This flat two-level structure does not capture hierarchical relationships or allow easy expansion into other threat domains beyond phishing. It also does not distinguish between attack techniques, tactics, or impacted assets.",
